By sharing the investment, companies are sharing the risk of losing resources requiring allocation.
At first, companies may be skeptical of forming such joint ventures.
然而, the advantages can often significantly outweigh the risks and should be determined with great care and meditation on a case by case basis. Promotion Alliances
Firms that have the same target audience and customer base may be able to leverage that of other companies to significantly reduce customer acquisition cost.
The company may form such a relationship using an affiliate agreement, cross-promotions, and price per lead or other relationship that is determined on a case by case basis.
An expensive public relations campaign or coverage in a national media outlet may be advantageous to more than one company, especially to those along the supply chain.
