They will be empowered in unprecedented ways, enjoying access to lower costs of debt and equity capital and greater capital partner choices, whether for business expansion or an exit.
Those that do will deliver exceptional service and outcomes to their clients by reaching beyond the predictable strategic buyer and PE buyers when they take companies to market.
The source of competitive advantage for private equity professionals will shift to their industry expertise, their reputation as a partner to CEOs, and their ability to align their deal-sourcing efforts against their points of differentiation.
This information-enabled transformation of private capital markets is very much in keeping with American ideals of competition, meritocracy, and free choice.
